  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Nothing is beyond your grasp.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Greater Steal<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You do not have to have a hand free to attempt a steal combat maneuver. If you expend a use of mythic power, you can attempt to steal an item secured in a bag or pouch, or worn closely on the body (such as a ring or gloves), though not something that requires more than a standard action for the wearer to remove (such as armor). The target gains a +10 bonus to his CMD against steal combat maneuvers made against items closely worn or stored in containers.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc155\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
